.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-pr-link 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-pr\-link \- Write the closing key into a bot pull request\*(Aqs body, so its merge moves the row
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten pr link\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIpr\fR> <\fIkey\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write the closing key into a bot pull request\*(Aqs body, so its merge moves the row
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIpr\fR>
The pull request number this verb is about
.TP
<\fIkey\fR>
The tracker key the pull request should close
